   {:label "(b)",
    :body
    "Suppose now that $f(x)=\\chi_K(X)$ for almost every $x\\in [0,1]$, \nwhere $K$ is a compact subset of $[0,1]$ with positive Lebesgue\nmeasure and empty interior. Prove that $f$ is not Riemann integrable."}],
