  [{:label "(a)",
    :body "Prove that the characteristic of $F$ is not $p$."}
   {:label "(b)", :body "Prove that $x^p-1=\\prod_{i=1}^p(x-z^i)$."}
   {:label "(c)",
    :body
    "Now (and in the next two following parts) suppose that \n$\\alpha\\notin F$ but $\\alpha^p=\\omega\\in F$.\nShow that $F(\\alpha)$ is a Galois extension of $F$."}
   {:label "(d)",
    :body
