   {:label "(d)",
    :body
    "Show that there exists a $u\\in H_0^1(0,1)$ such that $u_n$\nconverges weakly to $u$ in $H_0^1(0,1)$. Hint: show that the sequence\n$\\{u_n\\}$ is bounded."}
